 "transcript": "Could one username hack your account, destroy your game, and ban you? His name was 1x1x1x1. His name first appeared in 2007, in the description of a spooky Roblox hat called the Necrobloxicon. Then exploiters wrecked games and signed their chaos with his name, so every crash looked like proof. But in 2011, a Roblox admin revealed the truth. 1x1x1x1 was a test account created by an admin named Shedletsky for a story. He was never a hacker, the hacker never existed, so the answer is no, but the legend lives on as a killer in the game for saken.",
